  "slug": "cream-cheese-deviled-eggs",
  "name": "Cream Cheese Deviled Eggs",
  "recipe_type": "appetizer",
  "brief_description": "You can make your deviled eggs a hit at your next party or potluck by using cream cheese for delicious flavor and texture.",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Halve eggs lengthwise; transfer yolks to a small bowl and mash with a fork. Stir in cream cheese, mustard, and vinegar, then season with salt and pepper. Fill egg white halves with yolk mixture."
    }
  ],
